{"seq":2,"slug":"wasm-pack","title":"wasm-pack 打包工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/wasm-pack","wordCount":743,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"wasm-pack-打包工具\">wasm-pack 打包工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>wasm-pack</code> 是 Rust→WASM 的<strong>一体化工作流封装</strong>，把 <code>cargo build</code> → <code>wasm-bindgen</code> → <code>wasm-opt</code> → <code>npm publish</code> 串成一条命令。它通过三种构建目标控制产物形态：<code>web</code>（面向浏览器的 ES Module）、<code>bundler</code>（交给 Vite/webpack 等打包器）、<code>nodejs</code>（CommonJS）。产出集中在一个 <code>pkg/</code> 目录，内含 WASM 二进制、JS 胶水代码、TypeScript 类型声明与 <code>package.json</code>，因此产物可以像普通 npm 包一样被前端项目引入。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流概览\">工作流概览</h2><p>wasm-pack 是 Rust WASM 项目的一站式构建工具，整合了编译、wasm-bindgen 处理、npm 包生成和发布的完整流程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;curl https://rustwasm.github.io/wasm-pack/installer/init.sh -sSf | sh&#10;&#10;# 创建新项目&#10;wasm-pack new my-wasm-lib&#10;cd my-wasm-lib&#10;&#10;# 构建&#10;wasm-pack build --target web&#10;&#10;# 测试&#10;wasm-pack test --headless --chrome&#10;&#10;# 发布到 npm&#10;wasm-pack publish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://rustwasm.github.io/wasm-pack/installer/init.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sSf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建新项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-wasm-lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-wasm-lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --headless</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --chrome</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 发布到 npm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SRC[&quot;Rust 源码&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;wasm-pack build&quot;| CARGO[&quot;cargo build&lt;br/&gt;--target wasm32&quot;]&#10;    CARGO --&gt; WASM_RAW[&quot;原始 .wasm&quot;]&#10;    WASM_RAW --&gt;|&quot;wasm-bindgen&quot;| GLUE[&quot;JS 胶水 + .d.ts&quot;]&#10;    WASM_RAW --&gt;|&quot;wasm-opt&quot;| OPTIMIZED[&quot;.wasm (优化后)&quot;]&#10;    GLUE --&gt; PKG[&quot;pkg/ 目录&quot;]&#10;    OPTIMIZED --&gt; PKG&#10;    PKG --&gt;|&quot;npm publish&quot;| NPM[&quot;npm 仓库&quot;]\">graph LR\n    SRC[\"Rust 源码\"] --&gt;|\"wasm-pack build\"| CARGO[\"cargo build&lt;br/&gt;--target wasm32\"]\n    CARGO --&gt; WASM_RAW[\"原始 .wasm\"]\n    WASM_RAW --&gt;|\"wasm-bindgen\"| GLUE[\"JS 胶水 + .d.ts\"]\n    WASM_RAW --&gt;|\"wasm-opt\"| OPTIMIZED[\".wasm (优化后)\"]\n    GLUE --&gt; PKG[\"pkg/ 目录\"]\n    OPTIMIZED --&gt; PKG\n    PKG --&gt;|\"npm publish\"| NPM[\"npm 仓库\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>常用选项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>wasm-pack new</code></td>\n<td>创建项目模板</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-pack build</code></td>\n<td>编译并生成 npm 包</td>\n<td><code>--target</code>、<code>--release</code>、<code>--out-dir</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-pack test</code></td>\n<td>运行浏览器/Node.js 测试</td>\n<td><code>--headless</code>、<code>--chrome</code>/<code>--firefox</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-pack publish</code></td>\n<td>发布到 npm</td>\n<td><code>--access public</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-pack login</code></td>\n<td>npm 登录</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>wasm-pack build</code> 默认使用 <code>--release</code> 模式。如果需要调试信息，显式传入 <code>--dev</code> 标志。开发阶段建议使用 <code>--dev --target web</code> 获得更快的编译速度和更好的调试体验。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建目标\">构建目标</h2><p>wasm-pack 支持三种构建目标，决定了生成的 JS 胶水代码的模块格式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>模块格式</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>web</td>\n<td><code>--target web</code></td>\n<td>ES Modules</td>\n<td>现代浏览器直接使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bundler</td>\n<td><code>--target bundler</code></td>\n<td>ES Modules</td>\n<td>webpack/Vite 打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nodejs</td>\n<td><code>--target nodejs</code></td>\n<td>CommonJS</td>\n<td>Node.js 环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>no-modules</td>\n<td><code>--target no-modules</code></td>\n<td>全局变量</td>\n<td>无模块系统的环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// --target web: ES Module 加载&#10;import init, { greet } from &#39;./pkg/my_wasm.js&#39;;&#10;await init();&#10;greet(&#39;World&#39;);&#10;&#10;// --target bundler: 由打包工具处理&#10;import { greet } from &#39;my-wasm-lib&#39;;&#10;greet(&#39;World&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// --target web: ES Module 加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { greet } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './pkg/my_wasm.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// --target bundler: 由打包工具处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { greet } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'my-wasm-lib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Cargo.toml&#10;// [lib]&#10;// crate-type = [&quot;cdylib&quot;, &quot;rlib&quot;]&#10;//&#10;// [dependencies]&#10;// wasm-bindgen = &quot;0.2&quot;&#10;//&#10;// [profile.release]&#10;// lto = true&#10;// opt-level = &quot;s&quot;        # 优化体积&#10;// # opt-level = 3        # 优化速度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [lib]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// crate-type = [\"cdylib\", \"rlib\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// wasm-bindgen = \"0.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// lto = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// opt-level = \"s\"        # 优化体积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// # opt-level = 3        # 优化速度</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BUILD[&quot;wasm-pack build&quot;] --&gt; TARGET{目标选择}&#10;    TARGET --&gt;|&quot;--target web&quot;| WEB[&quot;ES Module&lt;br/&gt;需要 init()&quot;]&#10;    TARGET --&gt;|&quot;--target bundler&quot;| BUNDLER[&quot;ES Module&lt;br/&gt;打包工具处理初始化&quot;]&#10;    TARGET --&gt;|&quot;--target nodejs&quot;| NODE[&quot;CommonJS&lt;br/&gt;require() 使用&quot;]&#10;    WEB --&gt; BROWSER[&quot;浏览器直接使用&quot;]&#10;    BUNDLER --&gt; WEBPACK[&quot;webpack / Vite&quot;]&#10;    NODE --&gt; NODEJS[&quot;Node.js 应用&quot;]\">graph TD\n    BUILD[\"wasm-pack build\"] --&gt; TARGET{目标选择}\n    TARGET --&gt;|\"--target web\"| WEB[\"ES Module&lt;br/&gt;需要 init()\"]\n    TARGET --&gt;|\"--target bundler\"| BUNDLER[\"ES Module&lt;br/&gt;打包工具处理初始化\"]\n    TARGET --&gt;|\"--target nodejs\"| NODE[\"CommonJS&lt;br/&gt;require() 使用\"]\n    WEB --&gt; BROWSER[\"浏览器直接使用\"]\n    BUNDLER --&gt; WEBPACK[\"webpack / Vite\"]\n    NODE --&gt; NODEJS[\"Node.js 应用\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pkg-目录结构\">pkg 目录结构</h2><p>构建完成后，<code>pkg/</code> 目录包含完整的 npm 包内容。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"pkg/&#10;├── my_wasm_bg.wasm          # 编译后的 WASM 二进制&#10;├── my_wasm_bg.wasm.d.ts     # WASM 二进制的 TS 类型&#10;├── my_wasm.js               # JS 胶水代码（入口）&#10;├── my_wasm.d.ts             # TypeScript 类型声明&#10;├── package.json             # npm 包描述&#10;├── README.md                # 从项目根目录复制&#10;└── snippets/                # 内联 JS 片段\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pkg/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── my_wasm_bg.wasm          # 编译后的 WASM 二进制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── my_wasm_bg.wasm.d.ts     # WASM 二进制的 TS 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── my_wasm.js               # JS 胶水代码（入口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── my_wasm.d.ts             # TypeScript 类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json             # npm 包描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── README.md                # 从项目根目录复制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── snippets/                # 内联 JS 片段</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-wasm-lib&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.1.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;my_wasm_bg.wasm&quot;, &quot;my_wasm.js&quot;, &quot;my_wasm.d.ts&quot;],&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;my_wasm.js&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;my_wasm.d.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sideEffects&quot;: [&quot;./snippets/*&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-wasm-lib\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my_wasm_bg.wasm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my_wasm.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my_wasm.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my_wasm.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my_wasm.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sideEffects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./snippets/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>大小参考</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>*_bg.wasm</code></td>\n<td>核心二进制</td>\n<td>数 KB ~ 数 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>*.js</code></td>\n<td>JS 胶水代码</td>\n<td>数 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>*.d.ts</code></td>\n<td>TypeScript 类型</td>\n<td>数 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>package.json</code></td>\n<td>npm 包元数据</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果你的 WASM 包需要发布为 scoped 包（如 <code>@myorg/my-wasm</code>），在 <code>Cargo.toml</code> 的 <code>[package.metadata.wasm-pack.profile.release]</code> 中无法设置包名。需要在构建后手动修改 <code>pkg/package.json</code> 的 <code>name</code> 字段，或使用 <code>--scope</code> 选项。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建优化\">构建优化</h2><p>生产级 WASM 构建需要多层优化以平衡体积和性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[profile.release]&#10;lto = true&#10;opt-level = &quot;z&quot;&#10;codegen-units = 1&#10;strip = true&#10;&#10;[package.metadata.wasm-pack.profile.release]&#10;wasm-opt = [&quot;-Oz&quot;, &quot;--enable-simd&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lto = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opt-level = \"z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>codegen-units = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strip = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[package.metadata.wasm-pack.profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wasm-opt = [\"-Oz\", \"--enable-simd\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LTO（链接时优化）</td>\n<td><code>lto = true</code></td>\n<td>减少 10-20% 体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积优化级别</td>\n<td><code>opt-level = &quot;z&quot;</code></td>\n<td>最小体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度优化级别</td>\n<td><code>opt-level = 3</code></td>\n<td>最大性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单编译单元</td>\n<td><code>codegen-units = 1</code></td>\n<td>更好的优化机会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号剥离</td>\n<td><code>strip = true</code></td>\n<td>移除调试符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wasm-opt</td>\n<td><code>wasm-opt -Oz</code></td>\n<td>WASM 级别优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gzip/Brotli 压缩</td>\n<td>服务端配置</td>\n<td>传输体积减少 60-80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 手动优化流程&#10;wasm-pack build --release --target web&#10;&#10;# 进一步用 wasm-opt 优化&#10;wasm-opt pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm -Oz -o pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm&#10;&#10;# 查看体积&#10;ls -lh pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm&#10;&#10;# Brotli 压缩&#10;brotli pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm&#10;ls -lh pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm.br\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动优化流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 进一步用 wasm-opt 优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-opt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Oz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看体积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -lh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Brotli 压缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brotli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -lh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pkg/my_wasm_bg.wasm.br</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    RAW[&quot;原始 .wasm&lt;br/&gt;500 KB&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;opt-level=z + LTO&quot;| OPT1[&quot;Release 构建&lt;br/&gt;200 KB&quot;]&#10;    OPT1 --&gt;|&quot;wasm-opt -Oz&quot;| OPT2[&quot;wasm-opt 优化&lt;br/&gt;160 KB&quot;]&#10;    OPT2 --&gt;|&quot;strip debug&quot;| OPT3[&quot;剥离调试信息&lt;br/&gt;120 KB&quot;]&#10;    OPT3 --&gt;|&quot;Brotli 压缩&quot;| FINAL[&quot;传输大小&lt;br/&gt;40 KB&quot;]\">graph TD\n    RAW[\"原始 .wasm&lt;br/&gt;500 KB\"] --&gt;|\"opt-level=z + LTO\"| OPT1[\"Release 构建&lt;br/&gt;200 KB\"]\n    OPT1 --&gt;|\"wasm-opt -Oz\"| OPT2[\"wasm-opt 优化&lt;br/&gt;160 KB\"]\n    OPT2 --&gt;|\"strip debug\"| OPT3[\"剥离调试信息&lt;br/&gt;120 KB\"]\n    OPT3 --&gt;|\"Brotli 压缩\"| FINAL[\"传输大小&lt;br/&gt;40 KB\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-发布流程\">npm 发布流程</h2><p>将 WASM 包发布到 npm 后，前端项目可以像使用普通 npm 包一样使用它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 第一次发布&#10;wasm-pack login&#10;wasm-pack build --release --target bundler --scope myorg&#10;wasm-pack publish --access public&#10;&#10;# 更新版本&#10;# 修改 Cargo.toml 中的 version 字段&#10;wasm-pack build --release --target bundler&#10;wasm-pack publish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 第一次发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundler</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --scope</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myorg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --access</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> public</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 更新版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改 Cargo.toml 中的 version 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/my-wasm&quot;: &quot;^0.1.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/my-wasm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^0.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { initSync, greet } from &#39;@myorg/my-wasm&#39;;&#10;&#10;const wasmUrl = new URL(&#39;@myorg/my-wasm/my_wasm_bg.wasm&#39;, import.meta.url);&#10;const response = await fetch(wasmUrl);&#10;const bytes = await response.arrayBuffer();&#10;initSync(bytes);&#10;&#10;const result = greet(&#39;npm 用户&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { initSync, greet } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@myorg/my-wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wasmUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/my-wasm/my_wasm_bg.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wasmUrl);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">initSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'npm 用户'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发布步骤</th>\n<th>命令/操作</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>登录 npm</td>\n<td><code>wasm-pack login</code></td>\n<td>需要 npm 账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建包</td>\n<td><code>wasm-pack build --release</code></td>\n<td>确认 target 正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设置 scope</td>\n<td><code>--scope myorg</code></td>\n<td>组织包需要 <code>--access public</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布</td>\n<td><code>wasm-pack publish</code></td>\n<td>遵循 semver 版本规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI/CD 发布</td>\n<td><code>NPM_TOKEN</code> 环境变量</td>\n<td>配合 GitHub Actions</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 同一个 Rust WASM 库可以同时发布到 crates.io（<code>cargo publish</code>）和 npm（<code>wasm-pack publish</code>），让 Rust 和 JS 开发者都能使用你的库。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((wasm-pack))&#10;    工作流&#10;      new/build/test/publish&#10;      一站式工具&#10;      整合 cargo + wasm-bindgen&#10;    构建目标&#10;      web / bundler / nodejs&#10;      ES Module / CommonJS&#10;      按场景选择&#10;    pkg 目录&#10;      .wasm 二进制&#10;      .js 胶水代码&#10;      .d.ts 类型声明&#10;    构建优化&#10;      LTO + opt-level&#10;      wasm-opt 二次优化&#10;      Brotli 压缩传输&#10;    npm 发布&#10;      scope 包支持&#10;      CI/CD 自动化&#10;      semver 版本管理\">mindmap\n  root((wasm-pack))\n    工作流\n      new/build/test/publish\n      一站式工具\n      整合 cargo + wasm-bindgen\n    构建目标\n      web / bundler / nodejs\n      ES Module / CommonJS\n      按场景选择\n    pkg 目录\n      .wasm 二进制\n      .js 胶水代码\n      .d.ts 类型声明\n    构建优化\n      LTO + opt-level\n      wasm-opt 二次优化\n      Brotli 压缩传输\n    npm 发布\n      scope 包支持\n      CI/CD 自动化\n      semver 版本管理</pre><ul>\n<li>wasm-pack 整合了 <code>cargo build</code> → <code>wasm-bindgen</code> → <code>wasm-opt</code> → <code>npm publish</code> 的完整工作流。</li>\n<li>三种构建目标（<code>web</code>/<code>bundler</code>/<code>nodejs</code>）对应不同的模块格式和使用场景。</li>\n<li><code>pkg/</code> 目录包含 WASM 二进制、JS 胶水代码、TypeScript 类型声明和 package.json。</li>\n<li>生产构建通过 <strong>LTO + opt-level + wasm-opt + Brotli</strong> 多层优化，可将传输体积压缩到原始的 10-20%。</li>\n<li>WASM 包可以发布到 npm 仓库，前端项目像使用普通 npm 包一样引入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"wasm-pack 打包工具","id":"wasm-pack-打包工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流概览","id":"工作流概览"},{"level":2,"text":"构建目标","id":"构建目标"},{"level":2,"text":"pkg 目录结构","id":"pkg-目录结构"},{"level":2,"text":"构建优化","id":"构建优化"},{"level":2,"text":"npm 发布流程","id":"npm-发布流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"wasm-bindgen 绑定生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/wasm-bindgen"},"next":{"title":"内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/memory-management"}}